---
---
<section class="py-20 md:py-28">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-4 max-w-3xl">
      Colleagues that work anywhere.
    </h2>
    <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-[#6B6B6B] max-w-5xl mb-12 leading-relaxed">
      Colleagues aren't limited to one surface. Eluu lets you deploy them wherever work happens — in Slack for your team, embedded in your product for customers, or running in the background through your API. Same platform, same memory, same abilities.
    </p>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <!-- Internal teams -->
      <div class="bg-[#E8E3DA] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
        <div class="p-6">
          <!-- Mini colleague sidebar mockup -->
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm mb-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
              <span class="text-sm font-semibold">Agentic Colleagues</span>
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-[#6B6B6B]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-3">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-pink-200 flex items-center justify-center text-[10px]">L</div>
                <div>
                  <p class="text-xs font-medium">Lewis (Marketing outreach)</p>
                  <p class="text-[10px] text-green-600">Working on 7 tasks...</p>
                </div>
                <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-[#6B6B6B] ml-auto" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-amber-200 flex items-center justify-center text-[10px]">J</div>
                <div>
                  <p class="text-xs font-medium">Jane (Product Manager)</p>
                  <p class="text-[10px] text-[#6B6B6B]">Paused — waiting for approval</p>
                </div>
                <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-[#6B6B6B] ml-auto" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-blue-200 flex items-center justify-center text-[10px]">P</div>
                <div>
                  <p class="text-xs font-medium">Prime (Revenue specialist)</p>
                  <p class="text-[10px] text-[#6B6B6B]">Scheduled: 8am tomorrow</p>
                </div>
                <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-[#6B6B6B] ml-auto" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="px-6 pb-6">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Internal teams</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#6B6B6B] leading-relaxed">
            Colleagues that live in Slack, work across your internal tools, and handle recurring work so your team focuses on decisions, not data gathering or repetitive actions.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- In your product -->
      <div class="bg-[#E8E3DA] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
        <div class="p-6">
          <!-- Chat widget mockup -->
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm mb-4 space-y-3">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
              <div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-green-500 flex items-center justify-center">
                <span class="text-white text-xs font-bold">P</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-xs font-semibold">Phoenix Onboarding Agent</p>
                <p class="text-[10px] text-[#6B6B6B]">Built on Eluu AI</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-[#F5F5F5] rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-xs max-w-[200px]">
              I have a product query, can you help me?
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white border border-black/10 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-xs">
              Of course! Phoenix is designed to help you design products with ease. What can I help you with today?
            </div>
            <div class="bg-[#F5F5F5] rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-xs max-w-[220px]">
              How do I configure SSO for my team? It doesn't seem to be working.
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white border border-black/10 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-xs">
              SSO requires one of our support engineers to help you setup. Let me check if a support engineer is available...
            </div>
            <p class="text-[10px] text-[#6B6B6B]">Checking with solution engineer... ›</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="px-6 pb-6">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">In your product</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#6B6B6B] leading-relaxed">
            Colleagues trained on your knowledge base and aware of each customer's context. They live inside your product and handle support, onboarding, and documentation.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- In your backend -->
      <div class="bg-[#E8E3DA] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
        <div class="p-6">
          <!-- Terminal/code mockup -->
          <div class="bg-[#1A1A2E] rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm mb-4 font-mono text-xs text-white/80 space-y-1.5 min-h-[200px]">
            <p class="text-purple-300">&lt; Task started data_validation_04122025 &gt;</p>
            <p class="text-white/60">&lt; tool_use: Fetching records created today from salesforce &gt;</p>
            <p class="text-white">Fetched 200 records. Running 2 parallel sub-agents to fetch data.</p>
            <p class="text-white/60">&lt; sub_agents: Running web search to find data &gt;</p>
            <p class="text-white/60">&lt; script: Validating fetched data &gt;</p>
            <p class="text-white">Data enriched for 120 accounts in Salesforce. Running a parallel agents for 80 failed cases.</p>
            <p class="text-white/60">&lt; sub_agents: Running advanced web search &gt;</p>
            <p class="text-white/60">&lt; script: Validating fetched data &gt;</p>
            <p class="text-white">Data enriched for 200 accounts in Salesforce.</p>
            <p class="text-green-400">&lt; Task completed &gt;</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="px-6 pb-6">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">In your backend</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#6B6B6B] leading-relaxed">
            Colleagues that carry your brand into external environments — added to a customer's Slack or embedded in their product through the API.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
